{%- comment -%}
PFC Focuses - mirrors the Focuses band of the web home page (`/`): the page's
"N of M live focuses are red" headline, the re-pick callout when it is on, then the three
tiers. Each tier lists only the live focuses not green, worst first, with progress and
weeks red; green and parked focuses fold into counts. Payload: `trmnl_home.focus_payload`.

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles, framework classes only. A light is a shape
plus a word (`status_shape`): square RED, triangle YELLOW, circle GREEN; `status_chip`
fills RED and outlines YELLOW so the rows that need a look stand out.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% template status_shape %}
{%- if status == "RED" -%}
<svg width="0.75em" height="0.75em" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="10" height="10" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
{%- elsif status == "YELLOW" -%}
<svg width="0.8em" height="0.8em" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="6,0.5 11.5,11 0.5,11" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
{%- elsif status == "GREEN" -%}
<svg width="0.75em" height="0.75em" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="5.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
{%- endif -%}
{% endtemplate %}
{% template status_chip %}
{%- if status == "RED" -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} label--filled no-shrink">{% render "status_shape", status: status %} {{ status }}</span>
{%- elsif status == "YELLOW" -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} label--outline no-shrink">{% render "status_shape", status: status %} {{ status }}</span>
{%- else -%}
<span class="label {{ size }} no-shrink">{% render "status_shape", status: status %} {{ status }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
{% endtemplate %}
